COMPILATION OF: E48A11

D: Disk Print
L: List Source Program

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 1

   NO ERROR(S) IN PASS 2

PL/I-80 V1.4 COMPILATION OF: E48A11

   1 a 0000 E48A11:
   2 a 0006   procedure options(main);
   3 a 0006   /* [E2E-48/P1] `b = ^(k = 0)'.  Distinct from P14: there `^'
   4 a 0006      negates a TEST, here it negates a VALUE.  Whether DR emits
   5 a 0006      CMA (0x2F) after the flag trick, inverts the compare, or
   6 a 0006      refuses is UNMEASURED. */
   7 c 0006   dcl b bit(1) static initial('0'b);
   8 c 0006   dcl k fixed bin(15);
   9 c 0006   k = 0;
  10 c 000C   b = ^(k = 0);
  11 c 0018   put list('V=', b);
  12 c 003A   stop;
  13 a 003D end E48A11;

CODE SIZE = 003D
DATA AREA = 0005
FREE SYMS = 38AD
END  COMPILATION
